SCRIPT:TBORWave1approaches
"Mordor reinforcements are approaching from the west! \n Stand your ground men!"
End

SCRIPT:TBORWave2approaches
"A large battle group of Mordor forces attack the northern bridges! \n You are soldiers of Gondor! \n No matter what comes over that bridge, \n you will stand your ground!"
End

SCRIPT:TBORWitchking
"The Witch-King of Angmar has entered the battle! \n He brings with him GROND!"
End

SCRIPT:TBORGrondline1
"Great engines crawled across the field; and in the midst was a huge ram..."
End

SCRIPT:TBORGrondline2
"great as a forest-tree a hundred feet in length, swinging on mighty chains."
End

SCRIPT:TBORGrondline3
"Long had it been forging in the dark smithies of Mordor..."
End

SCRIPT:TBORGrondline4
"hideous head, founded of black steel, was shaped in the likeness of a ravening wolf; on it spells of ruin lay."
End

SCRIPT:TBORGrondline5
"Great beasts drew it, orcs surrounded it, and behind walked mountain-trolls to wield it."
End

SCRIPT:TBORGrondline6
"Grond they named it, in memory of the Hammer of the Underworld of old!"
End

SCRIPT:TBORTovictory
"The Lord of the Nazgûl is no more, \n as well as Grond! \n Now destroy the Witch-Kings Tower and end this Battle for the Ring!"
End

SCRIPT:TBORTheeaglesarecoming
"Gwaihir, The Windlord, has arrived to help defeat the armies of Mordor! \n Use him wisely!"
End

SCRIPT:TBOREomerSpearThrow
"Use Eomer's "Spear Throw" ability to bring down the beasts!"
End

SCRIPT:TBORFrodospotted
"The Witch-King has spotted Frodo!"
End